<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3411"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 04, 2005 - 4:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Found this on the net, it´s from 1997: <BR> <BR><a href="http://groups.google.dk/groups?q=bind%2B%2Btorture%2B%2Bkill%2B-btk&amp;hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;selm=5guqvr%24kvu%40alpha.sky.net&amp;rnum=4" target=_top>http://groups.google.dk/groups?q=bind&#43;%2Btorture&#43;% 2Bkill&#43;-btk&amp;hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;selm=5guqvr%24kvu%40alpha.sk y.net&amp;rnum=4</a> <BR> <BR>I wouldn&#39;t think it&#39;s in here they&#39;re looking I bet it&#39;s in alt.fetish. <BR>bind.torture.kill.tape-record and stuff.   <BR> <BR>skov <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
