</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 9:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Is this related to BTK? I don&#39;t know, but it&#39;s under the &#34;BTK&#34; heading &amp; it&#39;s HILARIOUS!!! <BR> <BR>Hurry &amp; visit it before it gets Deleted. &#40;Warning: It has some &#39;adult&#39; language.&#41;. One of the funniest threads I have ever seen, called, &#34;Hey Everyone, I Wanna Propose A Toast&#34;. And we on-line sleuths could use some humor! <BR> <BR><a href="http://forums.prospero.com/foxamw/messages/?msg=1171.1" target=_top>http://forums.prospero.com/foxamw/messages/?msg=11 71.1</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
