<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7129"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 12, 2005 - 6:26 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://www.patriciagragg.com/fiction_example.htm" target=_top>http://www.patriciagragg.com/fiction_example.htm</a> <BR> <BR>------------------------------------------------ <BR>&#34;He placed his knee on her back. &#34;Stop. No one will hear.&#34; He whipped the tights around her wrists and tied the ends together. He used the slip to bind her ankles. <BR>She thrashed her legs, tried to squirm away. <BR>He leaned more weight into the knee. Wonderful game.&#34; <BR> <BR>---------------------------------------------- <BR>&#34;If she shows up again, give her the brush off fast.&#34; Sunny swished her tea bag around the mug and then, brightening, said, &#34;Did you know that Kev has moved back?&#34; <BR> <BR>-------------------------------------- <BR>&#34;It’ll take time. Are you teaching today?&#34; <BR>Val shook her head with a grimace. She tried never to think of the pre-school tap class until she had to. &#34;I’m down to Tuesdays and Thursdays.&#34; <BR>--------------------------------------------- <BR>&#34;Is this about that killer thing? Don’t worry about me. I know karate.&#34; <BR>---------------------------------- <BR> <BR>This story takes place in Cordova Kansas and mentions btk 2x. But the streets mentioned are in Wichita. Some coincidental words and phrases in the story, such as &#34;bright&#34; is used alot,&#34;fox&#34; &#34;eyes glistening &#34; &#34;bind&#34;, telephone rings when hes done killing girl, about the girls hair &#34;soft red curls&#34; , family with the last name  &#34;BRICKells&#34;, &#34;red curls&#34; again, weird mailman in story. btk killer is mentioned twice, &#34;mirror&#34;,grocery store is called l&amp;n, sounds like dillon,&#34;vine&#34;. <BR> <BR>Just seems like a lot of things popped out at me. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7129-->
<!--Post: 7214--><!--Time: 1108285965-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7214"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Denise<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Denise<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 13, 2005 - 1:12 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->WOW, that is very eerie, that&#39;s alot of coincidences in one story.. the rape in the story includes her being binded with pantyhose, that story is pretty gruesome.. does this story have an author? I saw where it said &#39;unknown&#39; but I wonder if that lady wrote it? I think you found something that might have significance... but you never know?...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
